        ]
      },
      "normalizationVersion": "norm-spike-1",
      "textHash": "sha256:5009388d3ad9b61447c4742c2a8ec7f1b88cbe50719948dbd1d59a1de5bd0beb",
      "anchors": {
        "before": "sha256:199c467329ea2405f809cbbeac233f171f03094c437056175eab6adfc9a4a413",
        "after": "sha256:3e03c6a38ce73352315ebd8abcf31d9472075cebad6bb428f117b1a8c9060ca0"
      },
      "display": {
        "lines": "127",
        "section": "SRS §7"
      },
      "text": "- **V-S1 — Findings and ledger immutability.** Scope: every commit in the repository history, over `findings/**` and `ledger/**`. Generator: n ≥ 100 pipeline runs plus seeded tamper attempts. Property: every commit's diff over those paths is append-only — no modification, no deletion. Pinned witnesses: W-CS4-N (append), W-CS7-Δ1 (blocked rewrite)."
    },
    {
      "fragmentId": "sf:1e788ea0fcfeb504275c7019",
      "label": "V-S2",
      "kind": "text-span",
      "source": {
        "doc": "SPEC.md",
        "digest": "sha256:2428b115bafe685044b88f97ac11f6ba28e1179c45989ee1b596b72ae3c89450"
      },
      "locator": {
        "codepointRange": [
          18382,
          18903
        ]
      },
      "normalizationVersion": "norm-spike-1",
      "textHash": "sha256:871c626cf3629c6a498e40dec3566cfa7d46afe523111025dce985395bf92312",
      "anchors": {
        "before": "sha256:9c8a059bbe160d528db917f80e57c806cbd06f12cae6475057b528879955b8c4",
        "after": "sha256:d8b9da08a89143958ccb09cb2fea7432ed28235c24702b32ea71c6debdf1404b"
      },
      "display": {
        "lines": "128",
        "section": "SRS §7"
      },
      "text": "- **V-S2 — Adjudication recomputability.** Scope: every printed disposition and readiness line. Generator: all reports across n ≥ 50 runs, plus seeded corrupted records. Property: the printed lines recompute, by pure function, from the committed GradeRecords per method §6.2 — anyone, later, reaches the same verdict from the same record. (This — not bit-identical model output — is what \"a grade is reproducible\" honestly means; model-output stability is O-03's measurement, not this invariant's claim.) Pinned: W-CS3-N."
    },
    {
      "fragmentId": "sf:bc48bb37af496302d125f52f",
      "label": "V-S3",
      "kind": "text-span",
      "source": {
        "doc": "SPEC.md",
        "digest": "sha256:2428b115bafe685044b88f97ac11f6ba28e1179c45989ee1b596b72ae3c89450"
      },
      "locator": {
        "codepointRange": [
          18904,
          19131
        ]
      },
      "normalizationVersion": "norm-spike-1",
      "textHash": "sha256:089740d4d8f45ba97e9a83260991ac4afd7a57a8195b6e55ca44803ff1118aaf",
      "anchors": {
        "before": "sha256:349375f72e893495f6cd8f9ac4a76919f2f974da41b4b23335569c9372574cdb",
        "after": "sha256:87c9be796f6673e2137cd8a9bb2bb72fa0118aa8932e6c52c5655a5bbfd9f607"
      },
      "display": {
        "lines": "129",
        "section": "SRS §7"
      },
      "text": "- **V-S3 — Isolation.** Scope: every grading invocation. Generator: n ≥ 50 runs plus seeded contaminated manifests. Property: manifest ⊆ the R-S1 triple, hash recorded, violations rejected before adjudication. Pinned: W-CS2-Δ2."
    }
